{"id":"controls-and-keys","title":"Controls and keys","category":"getting-started","icon":"minecraft:comparator","summary":"Every key, mouse action and chat command a player uses in SkyRPG.","blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"SkyRPG adds a handful of keys on top of vanilla Minecraft, a lot of mouse actions inside its screens, and a set of chat commands. This page lists all of them in one place. Keys can be changed in Minecraft's Controls screen, under the "},{"x":"SkyRPG","b":true},{"x":" category."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Keys","anchor":"keys"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Default key"}],[{"x":"Action"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"K","b":true}],[{"x":"Open SkyRPG Menu"}],[{"x":"The menu with your Profile, Skills, Journal and more. Press again to close. See "},{"x":"K menu","link":"k-menu"},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"M","b":true}],[{"x":"Open World Map"}],[{"x":"Everything you have explored in this dimension. Press again to close. See "},{"x":"HUD and minimap","link":"hud-and-minimap"},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"=","b":true}],[{"x":"Minimap Zoom In"}],[{"x":"Zooms the minimap in, up to 4 pixels per block."}]],[[{"x":"-","b":true}],[{"x":"Minimap Zoom Out"}],[{"x":"Zooms the minimap out, down to a quarter pixel per block."}]],[[{"x":"B","b":true}],[{"x":"Open Backpack"}],[{"x":"Opens the backpack in your first backpack slot. See "},{"x":"Backpacks","link":"backpacks"},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"H","b":true}],[{"x":"Look up in Wiki"}],[{"x":"Hover an item in any inventory and press this to open its wiki entry."}]],[[{"x":"Right click","b":true},{"x":" (hold, with a wand)"}],[{"x":"Spell wheel (hold)"}],[{"x":"Opens the spell wheel while you hold it; release over a spell to select it. Rebind it under "},{"x":"SkyRPG","b":true},{"x":". See "},{"x":"Wands","link":"wands"},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"G","b":true}],[{"x":"Spell wheel (toggle)"}],[{"x":"Opens a wheel that stays open until you click a spell."}]],[[{"x":"Tab","b":true},{"x":" (hold)"}],[{"x":"Player list"}],[{"x":"Shows the SkyRPG player list with heads, ping and info panels. Can be switched off in "},{"x":"Settings","link":"settings"},{"x":"."}]]],"align":["l","l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Vanilla keys keep their normal job. The sneak key, jump key and sprint key also steer a griffin, see below."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Inside the K menu","anchor":"inside-the-k-menu"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Up and Down arrows"}],[{"x":"Move to the previous or next page"}]],[[{"x":"1","b":true},{"x":" to "},{"x":"9","b":true}],[{"x":"Jump to the first nine pages in the sidebar"}]],[[{"x":"K","b":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"Esc","b":true}],[{"x":"Close the menu. Esc first steps back inside a page, for example clearing a search."}]],[[{"x":"Scroll wheel"}],[{"x":"Scrolls the page"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Pages with a text field (Settings search, Pay, the bank) take digits and letters first, so numbers type instead of switching pages."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"In shops","anchor":"in-shops"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Click an offer"}],[{"x":"Buy one"}]],[[{"x":"Shift-click an offer"}],[{"x":"Buy a full stack"}]],[[{"x":"Right-click an offer"}],[{"x":"Choose how many: type a number, use the arrows, or pick a preset (1, 8, 16, 32, 64), then Enter"}]],[[{"x":"Click an item in the sell panel"}],[{"x":"Sell all of that item"}]],[[{"x":"Sell all","b":true}],[{"x":"Sell everything this keeper buys"}]],[[{"x":"Buy back","b":true}],[{"x":"Take back your last sale to this keeper for the same coins"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"h2","text":"At the bank and on the Pay page","anchor":"at-the-bank-and-on-the-pay-page"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Type an amount, "},{"x":"Enter","b":true}],[{"x":"Deposit (at the bank) or send (on the Pay page)"}]],[[{"x":"Shift+Enter","b":true},{"x":" at the bank"}],[{"x":"Withdraw"}]],[[{"x":"All","b":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"Half","b":true},{"x":" buttons"}],[{"x":"Move all or half of the coins"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Amounts accept "},{"x":"k","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"m","c":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"b","c":true},{"x":", so "},{"x":"2.5k","c":true},{"x":" is 2,500 and "},{"x":"1m","c":true},{"x":" is 1,000,000. See "},{"x":"Coins and the bank","link":"coins-and-bank"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"In conversations","anchor":"in-conversations"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Click, "},{"x":"Space","b":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"Enter","b":true}],[{"x":"Show all of the text, then go on"}]],[[{"x":"Click a choice, or press its number"}],[{"x":"Pick that answer"}]],[[{"x":"Esc","b":true}],[{"x":"Close the conversation"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"h2","text":"On the world map and HUD editor","anchor":"on-the-world-map-and-hud-editor"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Drag"}],[{"x":"Move the map"}]],[[{"x":"Scroll"}],[{"x":"Zoom towards the mouse"}]],[[{"x":"C","b":true}],[{"x":"Follow yourself"}]],[[{"x":"Right-click the map"}],[{"x":"Drop a waypoint"}]],[[{"x":"Click or right-click an icon"}],[{"x":"Track, share or remove it"}]],[[{"x":"Drag a box (HUD editor)"}],[{"x":"Move it"}]],[[{"x":"Scroll over a box (HUD editor)"}],[{"x":"Resize it, 0.5x to 2x"}]],[[{"x":"Right-click a box (HUD editor)"}],[{"x":"Hide or show it"}]],[[{"x":"R","b":true},{"x":" (HUD editor)"}],[{"x":"Reset the box under the mouse, or every box if the mouse is on none"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"See "},{"x":"Waypoints","link":"waypoints"},{"x":" and "},{"x":"HUD and minimap","link":"hud-and-minimap"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"In the world","anchor":"in-the-world"},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Right-click an NPC","b":true},{"x":" to talk, shop, bank, enchant or start slayer quests. See "},{"x":"NPCs","link":"npcs"},{"x":"."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click a weapon, tool or pickaxe","b":true},{"x":" to use its ability, such as Skyward Burst or Treefeller."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click an accessory","b":true},{"x":" to put it on. "},{"x":"Right-click a backpack","b":true},{"x":" in its slot to open it. Backpack and accessory slots sit in strips beside your inventory and hide while the recipe book is open."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click a pet item","b":true},{"x":" to move it into your pet storage and equip it. "},{"x":"Right-click a Griffin Whistle","b":true},{"x":" to add it to your stable and call it."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click a waystone","b":true},{"x":" to attune it. Right-click again to travel to another one."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click the Artisan Bench","b":true},{"x":" to craft."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Sneak and hit","b":true},{"x":" a node, planter or stump with an empty hand to pick it up."}]}]},{"t":"h3","text":"Casting with a wand","anchor":"casting-with-a-wand"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"With a "},{"x":"wand","link":"wands"},{"x":" in your main hand the mouse is for spells (anything that has a right-click use of its own, like a chest or an NPC, keeps it):"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Left click","b":true}],[{"x":"Cast the selected "},{"x":"spell","link":"spells"},{"x":". No melee swing, no block breaking"}]],[[{"x":"Hold left click","b":true},{"x":", release"}],[{"x":"Charge a chargeable spell (Fireball, Meteor) and cast it"}]],[[{"x":"Hold right click","b":true}],[{"x":"Open the spell wheel; move the mouse to a spell and release to select it"}]],[[{"x":"Sneak + right click","b":true}],[{"x":"Open the wand's spell slots to install or remove scrolls"}]],[[{"x":"Sneak + scroll wheel","b":true}],[{"x":"Select the next or previous spell"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"h3","text":"Riding a griffin","anchor":"riding-a-griffin"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"On the ground"}],[{"x":"In the air"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"W A S D","b":true}],[{"x":"Walk"}],[{"x":"Fly where you face"}]],[[{"x":"Jump","b":true}],[{"x":"Take off"}],[{"x":"Climb"}]],[[{"x":"Sneak","b":true}],[{"x":"Dismount"}],[{"x":"Descend"}]],[[{"x":"Sprint","b":true}],[],[{"x":"Glide faster, 1.75 times"}]]],"align":["l","l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"See "},{"x":"Mounts","link":"mounts"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Chat commands","anchor":"chat-commands"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Commands start with "},{"x":"/","c":true},{"x":" and are typed in chat. Anyone can use these."}]},{"t":"h3","text":"Money","anchor":"money"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Command"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/coins [player]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show your purse and bank, or another player's"}]],[[{"x":"/pay <player> <amount>","c":true}],[{"x":"Send coins from your purse"}]],[[{"x":"/sell","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/sell hand","c":true}],[{"x":"Sell the stack in your hand"}]],[[{"x":"/sell all","c":true}],[{"x":"Sell every stack of the item in your hand"}]],[[{"x":"/sell inventory","c":true}],[{"x":"Sell everything NPCs will buy"}]],[[{"x":"/worth","c":true}],[{"x":"Show what the item in your hand sells for"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"h3","text":"Travel","anchor":"travel"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Command"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/hub","c":true}],[{"x":"Go to Skyhaven after a 5 second stand-still warm-up (refused in combat; run it again to cancel)"}]],[[{"x":"/survival","c":true}],[{"x":"Go to the survival world, back to where you left, with the same warm-up"}]],[[{"x":"/waypoint ...","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/wp ...","c":true}],[{"x":"Make and use waypoints. See "},{"x":"Waypoints","link":"waypoints"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"h3","text":"Progress and info","anchor":"progress-and-info"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Command"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/skills [player]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show skills"}]],[[{"x":"/stats [player]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show stats"}]],[[{"x":"/quest","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/quest list","c":true}],[{"x":"List your quests"}]],[[{"x":"/quest track [id]","c":true}],[{"x":"Track a quest"}]],[[{"x":"/quest abandon <id>","c":true}],[{"x":"Give up an open side quest"}]],[[{"x":"/title","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/title locked","c":true}],[{"x":"List your earned or locked titles. See "},{"x":"Titles","link":"titles"}]],[[{"x":"/title set <id>","c":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"/title clear","c":true}],[{"x":"Wear an earned title, or take it off"}]],[[{"x":"/contracts","c":true}],[{"x":"List today's contracts"}]],[[{"x":"/event list","c":true}],[{"x":"Show running events"}]],[[{"x":"/event join [id]","c":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"/event leave [id]","c":true}],[{"x":"Join or leave an opt-in event. Typing "},{"x":".join","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":".leave","c":true},{"x":" in chat works too"}]],[[{"x":"/region","c":true}],[{"x":"Describe nearby danger regions"}]],[[{"x":"/layer","c":true}],[{"x":"Say which underground layer you are in"}]],[[{"x":"/items list","c":true}],[{"x":"List SkyRPG items"}]],[[{"x":"/pet","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/pet away","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/pet storage","c":true}],[{"x":"Show your pet, put it away, list your pet storage"}]],[[{"x":"/mounts","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/mounts call","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/mounts away","c":true}],[{"x":"List your stable, call your mount, put it away"}]],[[{"x":"/wiki [page]","c":true}],[{"x":"Open the in-game wiki"}]],[[{"x":"@skyhelper <question>","c":true},{"x":" in chat, or "},{"x":"/ask <question>","c":true}],[{"x":"Ask SkyHelper, the assistant. "},{"x":"/ask","c":true},{"x":" answers only you. See "},{"x":"SkyHelper","link":"skyhelper"}]],[[{"x":"/party ...","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/p ...","c":true}],[{"x":"Make and manage a party. See "},{"x":"Party","link":"party"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"h3","text":"Chat","anchor":"chat"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Command"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/msg","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/tell","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/w <player> <text>","c":true}],[{"x":"Whisper"}]],[[{"x":"/r <text>","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/reply <text>","c":true}],[{"x":"Reply to the last person who whispered you"}]],[[{"x":"/me <text>","c":true}],[{"x":"Describe an action"}]],[[{"x":"/pc <message>","c":true}],[{"x":"Send a message to your party"}]],[[{"x":"/party chat","c":true}],[{"x":"Switch your chat to party chat, and back"}]],[[{"x":"/emotes","c":true}],[{"x":"List the emotes. Click one to use it"}]],[[{"x":"/stickers","c":true}],[{"x":"List the stickers. Click one to put it in your message"}]],[[{"x":"/share screenshot [file]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show your newest screenshot, or a named one, to everyone"}]],[[{"x":"/chat level [player]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show your SkyRPG chat level, or another player's"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"See "},{"x":"Chat","link":"chat"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"callout","kind":"note","b":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Operators have more commands, such as "},{"x":"/coins give","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/slayer","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/event start","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/bench","c":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"/hubadmin","c":true},{"x":". They are not covered here."}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"See also","anchor":"see-also"},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"K menu","link":"k-menu"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Settings","link":"settings"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Chat","link":"chat"}]},{"s":[{"x":"HUD and minimap","link":"hud-and-minimap"}]}]}]}